WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.560 --> 00:00:05.279
You know, I told you over the last few months
that Dr. Anthony Foushee, who's the top infectious

00:00:05.279 --> 00:00:11.250
disease doctor in the country, needs a security
detail because of threats against him.

00:00:11.250 --> 00:00:16.890
And it's really a sort of glimpse, a peek
behind the curtain into the problems that

00:00:16.890 --> 00:00:19.349
we have as a country here in the United States.

00:00:19.349 --> 00:00:26.740
When the doctor trying to stop the pandemic
and save people has so many Americans wanting

00:00:26.740 --> 00:00:32.520
to hurt him, furious with him, believing that
he is trying to hurt Americans, targeting

00:00:32.520 --> 00:00:40.570
him as some kind of nefarious player in some
bizarre amalgam of conspiracy theories involving

00:00:40.570 --> 00:00:46.830
Bill Gates and micro chipping in RFID and
all sorts of stuff, he needs security.

00:00:46.830 --> 00:00:49.610
That's utterly unconscionable.

00:00:49.610 --> 00:00:55.530
Think about how crazy it is that in most countries,
a pandemic comes.

00:00:55.530 --> 00:01:00.790
Everybody defers to the public health officials
and to the doctors who specialize in infectious

00:01:00.790 --> 00:01:03.150
disease, not in the U.S.

00:01:03.150 --> 00:01:09.909
In the U.S., the pandemic comes and such a
large portion of the country is furious with

00:01:09.909 --> 00:01:16.229
the doctors that the doctors end up needing
security to protect them from Americans.

00:01:16.229 --> 00:01:17.409
Let that sink in.

00:01:17.409 --> 00:01:19.880
Well, now it's even worse.

00:01:19.880 --> 00:01:22.710
It's not just Dr. Foushee who is at risk.

00:01:22.710 --> 00:01:29.159
Dr. Foushee admitted earlier this week that
now his daughters need security to protect

00:01:29.159 --> 00:01:34.009
them because of the work that Dr. Foushee
is doing.

00:01:34.009 --> 00:01:40.299
Dr. Foushee said he and his family have required
continued security in the face of harassment

00:01:40.299 --> 00:01:45.780
and death threats because people are mad at
what he is doing in terms of the Corona virus

00:01:45.780 --> 00:01:46.780
pandemic.

00:01:46.780 --> 00:01:50.579
Trump said we have fifteen cases, which will
be zero soon in March.

00:01:50.579 --> 00:01:53.959
People are mad at Dr. Foushee and threatening
his family.

00:01:53.959 --> 00:01:57.819
A quote from a recent interview he did with
CNN commenting on this.

00:01:57.819 --> 00:02:01.999
Dr. Foushee says, the unseemingly things that
crises bring out in the world.

00:02:01.999 --> 00:02:03.069
I don't know if unseemingly.

00:02:03.069 --> 00:02:04.200
I don't know if that makes sense.

00:02:04.200 --> 00:02:08.560
But I'm quoting Dr. Foushee, the unseemingly
things that crises bring out in the world.

00:02:08.560 --> 00:02:12.489
It brings out the best of people and the worst
of people and getting death threats to my

00:02:12.489 --> 00:02:17.250
family and harassing my daughters to the point
where I have to get security.

00:02:17.250 --> 00:02:18.510
It's amazing.

00:02:18.510 --> 00:02:24.290
I wouldn't have imagined in my wildest dreams
that people who object to things that are

00:02:24.290 --> 00:02:30.799
pure public health principles are so set against
it and don't like what you say and I say,

00:02:30.799 --> 00:02:35.519
namely in the world of science, that they
actually threaten you.

00:02:35.519 --> 00:02:38.459
I mean, that to me is just strange.

00:02:38.459 --> 00:02:45.220
Now, what's really funny here is that Dr.
Foushee during this interview refers to there

00:02:45.220 --> 00:02:50.269
being a degree of anti science sentiment in
the United States.

00:02:50.269 --> 00:02:51.870
That is quite the understatement.

00:02:51.870 --> 00:02:53.829
Half the country according to multiple.

00:02:53.829 --> 00:02:57.200
Pulls doesn't even plan to get the coronavirus
vaccine.

00:02:57.200 --> 00:02:59.209
If and when it is available to them.

00:02:59.209 --> 00:03:01.890
But this is a this is a bigger issue.

00:03:01.890 --> 00:03:06.360
This anti intellectual ism that underlies
all of this has been growing for a long time.

00:03:06.360 --> 00:03:10.659
If you go back and read some of my favorite
authors, like the work of Carl Sagan from

00:03:10.659 --> 00:03:16.340
decades ago, if you look at what Isaac Asimov
wrote decades ago, they saw it coming.

00:03:16.340 --> 00:03:22.640
They've been sounding the alarm about not
sort of benign anti intellectual ism and anti

00:03:22.640 --> 00:03:25.840
science and rejection of science in the United
States.

00:03:25.840 --> 00:03:30.069
They have been sounding the alarm about the
real world impact that it was having and could

00:03:30.069 --> 00:03:32.560
potentially have significantly more of.

00:03:32.560 --> 00:03:33.939
They were completely correct.

00:03:33.939 --> 00:03:37.890
And for all of these folks who talk about,
as I mentioned yesterday, Trump derangement

00:03:37.890 --> 00:03:41.049
syndrome, which is just a term to stymie debate.

00:03:41.049 --> 00:03:49.719
We, if anything, have been not alarmist enough
about this issue of rejection of science,

00:03:49.719 --> 00:03:54.030
anti intellectual ism, and also pseudo intellectual
ism, which presents its own set of risks that

00:03:54.030 --> 00:03:55.700
I've previously discussed.

00:03:55.700 --> 00:04:01.219
Instead of revering our doctors and our scientists,
they've become enemies for I mean, would you

00:04:01.219 --> 00:04:05.330
say it's for 20, 30, 40 percent of the country?

00:04:05.330 --> 00:04:09.860
Imagine threatening someone for trying to
help the American people.

00:04:09.860 --> 00:04:15.810
Imagine threatening the children of someone,
trying to help the American people.

00:04:15.810 --> 00:04:21.120
And almost every day, Americans find new novel
ways to make the United States a laughing

00:04:21.120 --> 00:04:22.850
stock and a global embarrassment.

00:04:22.850 --> 00:04:27.960
And this is, in a sense, as I mentioned, you
know, when I mentioned Carl Sagan and Isaac

00:04:27.960 --> 00:04:30.920
Asimov, this was predicted.

00:04:30.920 --> 00:04:32.360
This is what happens after.

00:04:32.360 --> 00:04:39.560
On the one hand, decades of underfunding schools
and not prioritizing, understanding science

00:04:39.560 --> 00:04:42.060
and critical thinking and epistemology.

00:04:42.060 --> 00:04:46.110
And you combine that with a political party,
the Republican Party that benefits from that

00:04:46.110 --> 00:04:55.530
raises money on the basis of rejecting science
and also religiously based reactionary ideas,

00:04:55.530 --> 00:04:59.740
although that's not at the core of what we're
seeing now with the virus necessarily.

00:04:59.740 --> 00:05:01.030
There are more components.

00:05:01.030 --> 00:05:07.280
I'm being overly simplistic, but those are
two big important pieces of the analysis.

00:05:07.280 --> 00:05:12.250
Imagine what it's like for Dr. Foushee day
to day, going to work, trying to deal with

00:05:12.250 --> 00:05:19.380
100 year pandemic, seeing other countries
successfully do it, and knowing that not only

00:05:19.380 --> 00:05:25.140
are we failing because of the president, but
that the president is a huge part of why a

00:05:25.140 --> 00:05:30.789
large portion of the country hates Dr. Foushee,
some to the point that they would like to

00:05:30.789 --> 00:05:35.759
see him dead, redoubling my sentiments from
an earlier segment.

00:05:35.759 --> 00:05:39.630
We owe the world an explanation and an apology.

00:05:39.630 --> 00:05:42.930
And by the way, for if Trump wanted to stop
this.

00:05:42.930 --> 00:05:49.949
If Donald Trump spent a week saying, leave
Dr. Foushee alone, I don't want to hear anything

00:05:49.949 --> 00:05:54.210
about anybody going after Dr. Foushee or threatening
his family.

00:05:54.210 --> 00:05:56.680
His interest is the health of the American
people.

00:05:56.680 --> 00:06:01.300
If Trump did that, 95, 98, 99 percent of this
would stop.

00:06:01.300 --> 00:06:04.840
But instead, Trump is actually part of the
problem rather than the solution.

00:06:04.840 --> 00:06:10.410
Imagine being a health expert in the medical
field and having death threats hurled at you

00:06:10.410 --> 00:06:14.820
and your family for trying to protect the
public and having the president of the United

00:06:14.820 --> 00:06:21.530
States actually foment that treatment rather
than tell people to stop and to cut it out

00:06:21.530 --> 00:07:51.340
for lack of a better term.

00:07:51.340 --> 00:08:21.240
It's bad, really, really bad.

